{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Window\/defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Window"]]},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultLaunchBehavior","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"behavior","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SceneLaunchBehavior","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19SceneLaunchBehaviorV","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneLaunchBehavior"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This behavior can be used to define if a scene is shown on application"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"launch in the absence of any previously saved state."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On platforms that do not support multiple windows, this value is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On platforms other than Windows, there must be at least one scene that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presents itself. If no scenes are defined to present, the first scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will be presented, regardless of the value provided to this modifier."}]},{"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"During app launch, on platforms other than Windows, the system"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will only consider scenes whose role matches the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/bundleresources\/information_property_list\/uiapplicationpreferreddefaultscenesessionrole"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key in the application scene manifest of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist"},{"type":"text","text":" file."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For instance, a volumetric window would need the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIWindowSceneSessionRoleVolumetricApplication"},{"type":"text","text":" role."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On Windows, this behavior will also be used to determine which scene is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presented when clicking on the icon of a running application with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"visible windows."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On visionOS, the system may background the last dismissed scene instead"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of closing it. Thus, the suppressed behavior additionally specifies that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the scene should not be presented when tapping on the application icon"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with no visible windows."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, you may wish to present a welcome window on launch of your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app when there are no previous document windows being restored:"}]},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        DocumentGroup(newDocument: MyDocument()) { configuration in","            DocumentEditor(configuration.$document)","        }","","        Window(\"Welcome to My App\", id: \"welcome\") {","            WelcomeView()","        }","        .defaultLaunchBehavior(.presented)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The default value for all scenes if you do not apply this modifier is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneLaunchBehavior\/automatic"},{"text":". With that strategy, a scene","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"will only present itself if it is the first scene defined by the app,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and no other scenes have presented themselves.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets the default launch behavior for this scene."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/window\/defaultlaunchbehavior(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","title":"defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE21defaultLaunchBehavioryQrAA0dfG0VF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI6WindowV","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultLaunchBehavior"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19SceneLaunchBehaviorV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SceneLaunchBehavior"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Scene"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/SceneLaunchBehavior/automatic":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The automatic behavior."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneLaunchBehavior\/automatic","title":"automatic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"automatic","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19SceneLaunchBehaviorV","text":"SceneLaunchBehavior"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scenelaunchbehavior\/automatic"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Window":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that presents its content in a single, unique window."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Window","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Window","title":"Window","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Window","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/window"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Window/defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/window\/defaultlaunchbehavior(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultLaunchBehavior"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19SceneLaunchBehaviorV","text":"SceneLaunchBehavior"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene"}],"type":"topic","title":"defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Window\/defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets the default launch behavior for this scene."}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"OpenSwiftUI","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/SceneLaunchBehavior":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The launch behavior for a scene."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SceneLaunchBehavior","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneLaunchBehavior","title":"SceneLaunchBehavior","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"SceneLaunchBehavior","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scenelaunchbehavior"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Scene":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A part of an app’s user interface with a life cycle managed by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Scene","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","title":"Scene","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scene"}}}